# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere — in the repository AND in the
# working tree, on every platform. This overrides core.autocrlf, and because
# it is committed it applies to anyone who clones rather than depending on
# each developer's local Git configuration.
#
# Rationale: this project's code executes on Databricks (Linux). CRLF endings
# gain us nothing there, break shell scripts, and turn any cross-platform
# round-trip into a diff where every line looks modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never transform these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
